  m_text: '1. In a large bowl or container with a lid, combine and mix the sweetened
    condensed milk and all-purpose cream.


    2. Add the rest of the ingredients
    and toss until well combined.


    3. Cover the bowl with cling wrap and chill
    for several hours before serving; you may also freeze it.

'
